      "instance_name": "fruit_costumed_people_walking",
      "label": "people in fruit costumes walking together",
      "description": "Five people dressed in full-body fruit costumes (banana, kiwi, carrot, grapes, strawberry) are holding hands and walking down a street. They are arranged in a line, moving from left to right, with the banana-costumed person on the far left and the strawberry-costumed person on the far right. The scene is framed by urban buildings in the background and a paved street beneath their feet.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
